        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R4BB, 4\" x 4\" x 1/4\" Radius Steel Hinge with Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #9 x 1 wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a removable hinge pin. Utilizes Non-template ZigZag screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R4BB-specifications.gif?v=1704354730\" width=\"584\" height=\"274\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44R4BB Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification:</b> of the 4 Inch Ball Bearing Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4 Radius</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearings: 2 BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>ZigZag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R4BB-specifications.pdf?v=1704262349\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R4BB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
